      "id": "sol.ahsme-1960-p20.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The term using \\(k\\) factors of \\(-\\frac{2}{x}\\) has exponent \\[ 2(8-k)-k=16-3k. \\] To obtain \\(x^7,\\) we need \\(k=3.\\) Its coefficient is \\[ \\binom83\\left(\\frac12\\right)^5(-2)^3=-14. \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
      "hints": [
        "In a term using \\(k\\) copies of \\(-\\frac{2}{x},\\) determine the exponent of \\(x\\)",
        "Solve \\(16-3k=7\\) and then compute that binomial coefficient"
      ],
